# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
# core.autocrlf=true is set globally on the authoring machine; without this file
# the checked-out bytes would be CRLF and every SHA-256 asserted in tests or in
# MODEL_CARD.md would be wrong on Windows but right on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files whose byte content is asserted somewhere (tests, model card, provenance)
# get -text: no conversion at all, in either direction, on any platform.
docs/rfc/0001-chronos-2.md -text
examples/sample-data/** -text

# Binary
*.png binary
*.safetensors binary
*.parquet binary
